ime and streaming interactive world model Paper List  Matrix-Game 2.0: An open-source real-time and streaming interactive world model\n Preprint cited as reference [127] in AI for Games in the Foundation Model Era. arXiv preprint arXiv:2508.13009, 2025.\n作者 Xianglong He, Chunli Peng, Zexiang Liu, et al.\n发表年份 2025\n发表信息与来源 arXiv preprint arXiv:2508.13009, 2025.\n发表类型 预印本\n主要研究方向 玩家与世界建模\n研究方向 玩家与世界建模\n研究主题 方向：世界与玩家建模 动作接口与长程世界 视频与学习式世界模型\n原始发表页面 原始发表页面 https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.13009 \nPDF PDF https://arxiv.org/pdf/2508.13009 \narXiv ID 2508.13009\n书目来源 Survey reference [127] https://arxiv.org/html/2609.16679v1#bib.bib127 \n综述中的引用位置 4.4 Action Interfaces, Real-Time Generation, and Long-Horizon Consistency https://arxiv.org/html/2609.16679v1#S4.SS4 \n分类说明 Editorial roles and topics follow the survey’s cited sections and system index. These are navigation categories, not independently verified capability claims.\n源码状态 开源代码\n代码仓库与许可证 SkyworkAI/Matrix-Game · 2.0 代码仓库 https://github.com/SkyworkAI/Matrix-Game/tree/main/Matrix-Game-2 实现范围 研究实现 许可状态 开源许可证 代码许可 MIT 许可证原文 https://github.com/SkyworkAI/Matrix-Game/blob/main/LICENSE\n项目主页 Project homepage https://matrix-game-v2.github.io/ \nDemo 与运行配置 有文档的本地运行入口 体验入口 / 配置说明 https://github.com/SkyworkAI/Matrix-Game/blob/main/Matrix-Game-2/README.md#quick-start 体验类型 有文档的本地运行入口 访问条件 需要本地配置 使用说明 Use the Matrix-Game-2 directory rather than the root README, which now documents 4.0. The 2.0 README supplies installation, checkpoint-download and inference/streaming commands. It requires an Nvidia GPU with at least 24 GB memory, compatible PyTorch/FlashAttention and separate model checkpoints. The README specifies MIT; its local LICENSE target is absent, while the repository-root MIT license is available. No local inference was executed.\n实际使用注意事项 Use the Matrix-Game-2 directory rather than the root README, which now documents 4.0. The 2.0 README supplies installation, checkpoint-download and inference/streaming commands. It requires an 